 null`\n     - `"next_stages": []`\n\n7. **Validation requirement**\n   - Before finalizing output, internally verify:\n     - JSON is valid\n     - All stages are present\n     - All arrays and objects are closed\n     - Schema is satisfied exactly\n\n### Schema (MUST MATCH EXACTLY)\n{\n  "stages": [\n    {\n      "name": "string",\n      "description": "string",\n      "allowed_agents": ["string"],\n      "exit_condition": "string or null",\n      "terminal": true or false,\n      "next_stages": [\n        {\n          "name": "string",\n          "condition": "condition string" or null\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n----------------\n"""\n'}], 'options': {'temperature': 1.2, 'num_predict': 2048}}
